    "description": "The Loyalty Expiration Status API provides a mechanism for retrieving data regarding the expiration of loyalty points for customers. This endpoint allows businesses to monitor and manage loyalty program participation by checking which loyalty accounts have points nearing expiration. Typical consumers of this API include customer relationship management (CRM) systems, loyalty program dashboards, and financial reporting tools. By leveraging this API, businesses can proactively inform customers about their loyalty status and improve engagement strategies.",
